# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [dev]
- Added SceneCapture to DataMessage example.
- Added new directivity related data.
- Added simplified functions for IR generation with new function on settings called prepareIRandSignalGeneration(). 
- Added optimized IR synthesis method with base kernel.
- Added better documentation.

## [Released]

## [1.0.0] - 2026-01-09
- First release. 
- Compatible with SonoTraceUE v1.0.
